msgid "FfeD-QLC quickstart"
msgstr "FfeD-QLC inicio rapido"

#: ../../docs/tools/ffed-qlc/quickstart.md:3 01c605b0d051422a893d5729931aed7a
msgid "Requirements"
msgstr "Requisitos"

#: ../../docs/tools/ffed-qlc/quickstart.md:5 89dd486d3d5145238ed0d6f12ccc9152
msgid ""
"Use a clean checkout, the runtime declared by the repository, and its "
"committed lockfiles. Confirm the active branch before installing anything."
msgstr ""
"Use una copia limpia, el runtime declarado por el repositorio y sus archivos"
" de bloqueo confirmados. Confirme la rama activa antes de instalar nada."

#: ../../docs/tools/ffed-qlc/quickstart.md:11 fdb4e3269ff041bf96ba873085794f18
msgid "Install"
msgstr "Instalar"

#: ../../docs/tools/ffed-qlc/quickstart.md:19 026655d66db8495fad559ea683250ebf
msgid "Start"
msgstr "Comenzar"

#: ../../docs/tools/ffed-qlc/quickstart.md:26 531ba7b12a894eb1b599e1f108e33712
msgid "Verify"
msgstr "Verificar"

#: ../../docs/tools/ffed-qlc/quickstart.md:33 98b267fb3330492da4892e1bf7a8a74d
msgid "Human acceptance"
msgstr "Aceptacion humana"

#: ../../docs/tools/ffed-qlc/quickstart.md:35 8cc6c9bd291b42d08698a8ffb6fff5b1
msgid ""
"Inspect the output, logs, test results, and diff. Accept, request a "
"correction, quarantine, or stop; do not silently promote a generated result."
msgstr ""
"Inspeccione la salida, los registros, los resultados de pruebas y el diff. "
"Acepte, solicite una correccion, ponga en cuarentena o detengase; no "
"promueva silenciosamente un resultado generado."
